message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "seizure-eeg-extractor"
authors:
  - family-names: "Koerner"
    given-names: "Jamie"
version: "0.1.1"
license: "MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jamiekoe/seizure-eeg-extractor"
abstract: >-
  A Python package and command-line tool for extracting EEG signal arrays and
  seizure metadata from CHB-MIT and EU Epilepsy/EPILEPSIAE-style datasets into
  NumPy record folders.
keywords:
  - "EEG"
  - "seizure"
  - "epilepsy"
  - "CHB-MIT"
  - "EPILEPSIAE"
  - "data extraction"
